  "lines": [
    "We crossed into Costa Rica today",
    "By rfay - Posted on February 22nd, 2008",
    "Tagged: Inuvik to Ushuaia",
    "We crossed over into Costa Rica today after a long ferry ride on Lake Nicaragua and then a river boat ride up the Rio Frio into Los Chiles, Costa Rica.",
    "There are new photos on the photos page and the map of the route with all the details it up to date through Rio Blanco. And there are lots of articles on the incredible project and people at Agua Para La Vida at Rio Blanco.",
    "rfay's blog"
